    "Protection keeps running even when EqualEase Active is off because it observes the macOS input-volume property, not the system-audio routing path.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Protection keeps running even when EqualEase Active is off because it observes the macOS input-volume property, not the system-audio routing path."
          }
        },
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beskyttelsen fortsætter, selv når EqualEase Aktiv er slået fra, fordi den overvåger macOS-egenskaben for inputlydstyrke, ikke routingstien for systemlyd."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Schutz läuft weiter, auch wenn EqualEase Aktiv ausgeschaltet ist, weil er die macOS-Eigenschaft für Eingangslautstärke beobachtet, nicht den Systemaudio-Routing-Pfad."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La protección sigue funcionando aunque EqualEase esté desactivado, porque observa la propiedad de volumen de entrada de macOS, no la ruta de audio del sistema."
