    "Rules temporarily switch EqualEase based on what you're focused on. Website rules apply when that website is the active tab in a supported browser. When no rule matches, EqualEase returns to the selected default preset.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rules temporarily switch EqualEase based on what you're focused on. Website rules apply when that website is the active tab in a supported browser. When no rule matches, EqualEase returns to the selected default preset."
          }
        },
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Regler skifter midlertidigt EqualEase ud fra det, du fokuserer på. Webstedsregler gælder, når webstedet er den aktive fane i en understøttet browser. Når ingen regel matcher, vender EqualEase tilbage til den valgte standardforudindstilling."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Regeln schalten EqualEase vorübergehend je nach deinem Fokus um. Website-Regeln gelten, wenn diese Website der aktive Tab in einem unterstützten Browser ist. Wenn keine Regel passt, kehrt EqualEase zum ausgewählten Standardpreset zurück."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las reglas cambian EqualEase temporalmente según aquello en lo que tengas el foco. Las reglas de sitios web se aplican cuando ese sitio web es la pestaña activa en un navegador compatible. Cuando no coincide ninguna regla, EqualEase vuelve al preajuste predeterminado seleccionado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
