            "value": "WebSocket-Nachrichten müssen UTF-8-JSON sein."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los mensajes WebSocket deben ser JSON UTF-8."
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "Remote-control protocol error for non-JSON WebSocket text."
    },
    "When Active is off, EqualEase stops routing audio instead of only bypassing processing.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When Active is off, EqualEase stops routing audio instead of only bypassing processing."
          }
        },
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Når Aktiv er slået fra, stopper EqualEase lydrouting i stedet for kun at bypasse behandling."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn Aktiv ausgeschaltet ist, stoppt EqualEase das Audio-Routing, statt nur die Verarbeitung zu umgehen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cuando Activo está desactivado, EqualEase detiene la ruta de audio en lugar de solo omitir el procesamiento."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When enabled, EqualEase may restore audio routing after you launch the app.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When enabled, EqualEase may restore audio routing after you launch the app."
          }
        },
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Når dette er aktiveret, kan EqualEase gendanne lydrouting, efter du starter appen."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn aktiviert, kann EqualEase das Audio-Routing nach dem App-Start wiederherstellen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cuando está activado, EqualEase puede restaurar la ruta de audio después de abrir la app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When enabled, EqualEase requires a paired remote before it sends detailed state or accepts control commands. Keep this for trusted local networks: traffic is same-LAN only and not internet-grade encrypted. Pairing codes and tokens are never exposed through /health, /info, logs, or Settings after initial pairing.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When enabled, EqualEase requires a paired remote before it sends detailed state or accepts control commands. Keep this for trusted local networks: traffic is same-LAN only and not internet-grade encrypted. Pairing codes and tokens are never exposed through /health, /info, logs, or Settings after initial pairing."
          }
        },
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Når dette er aktiveret, kræver EqualEase en parret fjernbetjening, før appen sender detaljeret tilstand eller accepterer kontrolkommandoer. Behold dette for betroede lokale netværk: trafikken er kun på samme LAN og ikke krypteret på internetniveau. Parringskoder og tokens eksponeres aldrig gennem /health, /info, logge eller Indstillinger efter første parring."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn aktiviert, verlangt EqualEase eine gekoppelte Fernsteuerung, bevor es detaillierten Status sendet oder Steuerbefehle annimmt. Behalte dies für vertrauenswürdige lokale Netzwerke bei: Der Datenverkehr bleibt im selben LAN und ist nicht auf Internetniveau verschlüsselt. Kopplungscodes und Token werden nach der ersten Kopplung niemals über /health, /info, Protokolle oder Einstellungen offengelegt."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cuando está activado, EqualEase requiere un control remoto enlazado antes de enviar estado detallado o aceptar comandos de control. Mantén esto para redes locales de confianza: el tráfico solo va por la misma LAN y no tiene cifrado de nivel internet. Los códigos de enlace y tokens nunca se exponen mediante /health, /info, registros ni Ajustes después del enlace inicial."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When these are off, the quick panel hides the matching section and shrinks to fit. Diagnostics still shows routing, input state, and discovered app audio state.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When these are off, the quick panel hides the matching section and shrinks to fit. Diagnostics still shows routing, input state, and discovered app audio state."
          }
        },
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Når disse er slået fra, skjuler hurtigpanelet den tilsvarende sektion og krymper, så det passer. Diagnostik viser stadig routing, inputtilstand og funden app-lydtilstand."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn diese Optionen aus sind, blendet der Schnellbereich den passenden Abschnitt aus und verkleinert sich entsprechend. Diagnose zeigt weiterhin Routing, Eingangsstatus und erkannte App-Audiozustände."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cuando estas opciones están desactivadas, el panel rápido oculta la sección correspondiente y se reduce para ajustarse. Diagnóstico sigue mostrando la ruta de audio, el estado de entrada y el estado de audio de apps detectadas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When this is off, equalease:// links and AppleScript can still read EqualEase state and select built-in presets, but they cannot change Active, Volume, Preamp, Bypass, whether app preset switching is paused, or custom presets.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When this is off, equalease:// links and AppleScript can still read EqualEase state and select built-in presets, but they cannot change Active, Volume, Preamp, Bypass, whether app preset switching is paused, or custom presets."
          }
        },
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Når dette er slået fra, kan equalease://-links og AppleScript stadig læse EqualEase-tilstand og vælge indbyggede forudindstillinger, men de kan ikke ændre Aktiv, Lydstyrke, Preamp, Bypass, om skift af app-forudindstillinger er sat på pause, eller brugerdefinerede forudindstillinger."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn dies aus ist, können equalease://-Links und AppleScript weiterhin den EqualEase-Status lesen und integrierte Presets auswählen, aber sie können Aktiv, Lautstärke, Preamp, Bypass, die Pause des App-Preset-Wechsels oder eigene Presets nicht ändern."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cuando esto está desactivado, los enlaces equalease:// y AppleScript aún pueden leer el estado de EqualEase y seleccionar preajustes integrados, pero no pueden cambiar Activo, Volumen, Preamplificador, Bypass, si el cambio de preajuste por app está en pausa, ni los preajustes personalizados."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can turn EqualEase off anytime": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can turn EqualEase off anytime"
          }
        },
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du kan altid slå EqualEase fra"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du kannst EqualEase jederzeit ausschalten"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Puedes desactivar EqualEase en cualquier momento"
          }
        }
      }
    },
